        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After several time of back-and-forth on this, I decided to make a breaking change to indeed not call test case if there was at least one error in \"pre\" hooks. All \"post\" hooks will still be executed, though.\r\n\r\nThanks for your interest in 'mini.test'!",
